      "translation": "<a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.RequestOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>SubscriptionRequest.RequestOptions</code></a> 针对 <a href=\"TailableCursorRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>TailableCursorRequest</code></a> 的实现特定选项。",
      "count": 1
